 - **Limitations:** Extremely slow for high-resolution volumes or complex meshes; does not scale well with triangle count; prohibitive for real-time or iterative workflows [S1, unofficial].
-- **When to use:** Small meshes, low-resolution volumes, or prototyping.
-- **When not to use:** High-resolution SDFs, large meshes, or when performance is critical.
